{"ID":"20240206100241-75eyg6u","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240206100241-75eyg6u","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100241-75eyg6u\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206100256-wyhohk2\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185432-wl5q9gy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:854,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185432-wl5q9gy\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"化橘红","type":"doc","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206100256-wyhohk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100256-wyhohk2","updated":"20240206100312"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东化州、廉江等地\n【性状】\t药材呈对折的七角或展开的五角星状，单片呈柳叶形。完整者展开后直径1528cm，厚0.20.5cm。外表面黄绿色至黄棕色，有皱纹及小油室；内表面黄白色或淡黄棕色，有脉络纹。质脆，易折断。气芳香，味苦、微辛。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，温。\n【功效】\t散寒，燥湿，利气，消痰。用于风寒咳嗽、喉痒痰多、食积伤酒、呕恶痞闷。"}]},{"ID":"20240206100243-5yw7sw0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206100243-5yw7sw0","updated":"20240206100243"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206100243-7jpj2tx.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710123139-0ynk3kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710123139-0ynk3kp","updated":"20240710123139"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 636px;","style":"width: 626px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 6-20240710123139-p81rl8i.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 626px;\" parent-style=\"width: 636px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830154039-64eet1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830154039-64eet1t","updated":"20240830154039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 451px;","style":"width: 441px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 4-20240710115736-co5dv3h.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 441px;\" parent-style=\"width: 451px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 5-20240710115932-i75kasb.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830154039-pb71xif","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830154039-pb71xif","updated":"20240830154039"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 615px;","style":"width: 605px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240710123418-rfes29s.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 605px;\" parent-style=\"width: 615px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 612px;","style":"width: 602px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 9-20240710123910-bwo0ots.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 602px;\" parent-style=\"width: 612px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710115332-kpqr2n8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710115332-kpqr2n8","updated":"20240710115332"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 637px;","style":"width: 627px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚-20240710115332-z50e17g.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 627px;\" parent-style=\"width: 637px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 567px;","style":"width: 557px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 1-20240710115427-qsim28p.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 557px;\" parent-style=\"width: 567px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710115612-9vgyp38","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710115612-9vgyp38","updated":"20240710115612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 539px;","style":"width: 529px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 2-20240710115612-hrr2uku.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 529px;\" parent-style=\"width: 539px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 716px;","style":"width: 706px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 3-20240710115637-uzyt7bv.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 706px;\" parent-style=\"width: 716px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710123350-vq1au3e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710123350-vq1au3e","updated":"20240710123802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 339px;","style":"width: 329px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (8)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 8-20240710123758-01g65fy.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 329px;\" parent-style=\"width: 339px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 835px;","style":"width: 825px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚 7-20240710123656-m0nvr1q.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 825px;\" parent-style=\"width: 835px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240830154205-1bpvlia","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240830154205-1bpvlia","updated":"20240830154205"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 1176px;","style":"width: 1166px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"化州柚树 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/化州柚树 1-20240830154205-357f7jo.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 1166px;\" parent-style=\"width: 1176px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240710114113-l6q6gcv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240710114113-l6q6gcv","updated":"20240710123955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：化橘红跟陈皮不同，陈皮为橘子皮，化橘红为化州柚的未成熟或近成熟的干燥外层果皮；化橘红辛味、苦味较浓，比陈皮浓很多，吃起来有涩味，而陈皮有甘味；"}]},{"ID":"20240710113409-9fzswj9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240710113409-9fzswj9"}},{"ID":"20240902084520-usrr9ya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-usrr9ya","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中草药：化橘红"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-daugx6x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-daugx6x","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化橘红《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-6datau2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-6datau2","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HuàJúHónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-gvfslv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-gvfslv7","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】EXOCARPIUMCITRIGRANDIS"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-3yr5bhy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-3yr5bhy","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】化州桔红、橘红、毛橘红、光七爪、光五爪"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-22v9a2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-22v9a2a","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】本品为芸香科植物化州柚CitrusgrandisTomentosa或柚Citrusgrandis（L.）Osbeck的未成熟或近成熟的干燥外层果皮。前者习称“毛橘红”，后者习称“光七爪”“光五爪”。夏季果实未成熟时采收，置沸水中略烫后，将果皮割成5或7瓣，除去果瓤及部分中果皮，压制成形，干燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-es7h105","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-es7h105","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-bk0ml3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-bk0ml3d","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化州柚：呈对折的七角或展平的五角星状，单片呈柳叶形。完整者展平后直径15～28cm，厚0.2～0.5cm。外表面黄绿色，密布茸毛，有皱纹及小油室；内表面黄白色或淡黄棕色，有脉络纹。质脆，易折断，断面不整齐，外缘有1列不整齐的下凹的油室，内侧稍柔而有弹性。气芳香，味苦、微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-0umkgv7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-0umkgv7","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"柚：外表面黄绿色黄棕色，无毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-tnp84dm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-tnp84dm","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-qb26odx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-qb26odx","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（1）本品粉末暗绿色至棕色。中果皮薄壁细胞形状不规则，壁不均匀增厚，有的作连珠状或在角隅处特厚。果皮表皮细胞表面观多角形、类方形或长方形，垂周壁增厚，气孔类圆形，直径18～31μm，副卫细胞5～7个，侧面观外被角质层，靠外方的径向壁增厚。偶见碎断的非腺毛，碎段细胞多至十数个，最宽处直径约33μm，具壁疣或外壁光滑、内壁粗糙，胞腔内含淡黄色或棕色颗粒状物。草酸钙方晶成片或成行存在于中果皮薄壁细胞中，呈多面形、菱形、棱柱形、长方形或形状不规则，直径1～32μm，长5～40μm。导管为螺纹和网纹。偶见石细胞及纤维。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ym29oxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ym29oxd","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末1g，加甲醇10ml，加热回流20分钟，放冷，滤过，取滤液1ml，加四氢硼钾约5mg，摇匀，加盐酸数滴，即显樱红色或紫红色。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ols66lh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ols66lh","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3）取〔鉴别〕（2）项下的滤液作为供试品溶液。另取柚皮苷对照品，加甲醇制成每1ml含0.4mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录ⅥB）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各10μl，分别点于同一硅胶Ｇ薄层板上，以醋酸乙酯－甲酸－水（10:2:3）的上层溶液为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以三氯化铝试液，置紫外光灯（365nm）下检视。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ytm8npr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ytm8npr","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】辛、苦，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-7aub33w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-7aub33w","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】归肺、脾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-bb2gpgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-bb2gpgz","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】散寒，燥湿，利气，消痰。用于风寒咳嗽，喉痒痰多，食积伤酒，呕恶痞闷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-sarh2dq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-sarh2dq","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】3～6g。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-herajdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-herajdq","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【贮藏】置阴凉干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-f9ly31b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-f9ly31b","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-3d2zkdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-3d2zkdx","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化橘红《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-adiq581","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-adiq581","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】《识药辨微》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-w715lzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-w715lzs","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HuàJúHónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-iqkfimq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-iqkfimq","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】化皮（《岭南杂记》），化州橘红（《岭南随笔》），化州陈皮（《本草从新》），柚皮橘红（《中药志》），毛化（《广西中药志》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-kgbwb9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-kgbwb9o","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】为芸香料植物化州柚或柚的未成熟果实的外层果皮。7～8月摘取未成熟的果实，投入沸水中略烫后，即捞出，将果皮割成6～7瓣，除去果瓤及中果皮，然后晒干或焙干；再用水润透，对折，以木板压制成形，焙干。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-zlxu873","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-zlxu873","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-xmx08qv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-xmx08qv","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①化州柚，又名：化州仙橘（《岭南杂记》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-lbrfyj9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-lbrfyj9","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"常绿小乔木，高约3～3.5米。枝条粗壮斜生，幼枝被浓密柔毛，并有微小针刺。叶互生；叶柄的叶翼倒心脏形；有毛，主脉及叶翼边缘尤多；叶片长椭圆形，长8～13厘米，宽3～6厘米，先端浑圆或微凹入，基部圆钝，边缘浅波状，两面主脉上均有柔毛；叶质肥厚柔软。花极香，单生或腋生花序；萼4浅裂；花瓣白色，矩圆形；雄蕊20～25；子房圆形，花柱柱状，柱头极大。果实圆形或略扁，一般高10～15厘米，宽11～13厘米，柠檬黄色，油室大而明显，幼果密被白色绒毛；果顶圆钝，顶端内凹，果蒂四周略有棱起；果皮不易剥离，厚约2厘米；瓤囊16瓣，中心柱充实，果肉浅黄色，汁胞长大似纺锤形，味被酸。种子80粒以上，扁圆形，合点浅紫色。花期3月。果期8～9月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-qlu782p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-qlu782p","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本植物的花（柚花）、未成熟的幼小果实（橘红珠）亦供药用，各详专条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-lq6yphu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-lq6yphu","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②柚，详\"柚\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-zqe30q4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-zqe30q4","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】主产广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-otak3mr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-otak3mr","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】干燥的外果皮，呈对折的七角，六角或五角星形，展开后直径13～20厘米，厚2～3毫米。化州柚的外皮黄色或黄绿色，密布毛茸，有皱纹及小凹点，多作成七角，习称\"黄七爪\"、\"绿七爪\"；柚的外皮黄棕色，光而无毛茸，亦有皱纹及小凹点，多成五角形，习称\"大五爪\"；加工为六角形者，称\"六爪红\"，单片呈柳叶状者，习称\"尖化红\"，或称\"柳叶橘红\"。内表面多为黄白色，有脉络纹。质脆，易折断，断面不齐，外侧有一列不整齐的油点，内侧黄白色。气微香，味苦。以皮厚、多毛，气味浓厚者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-gnoo773","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-gnoo773","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】果实含柚皮甙、柚皮甙元；果皮含枸橼醛、香叶醇、芳樟醇、磷氨基苯甲酸甲酯等。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-52qozxe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-52qozxe","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】拣去杂质，刷净，用时擘碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ctzrzlz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ctzrzlz","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-hk24xib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-hk24xib","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苦辛，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-d8vma1h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-d8vma1h","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《纲目拾遗》：\"味苦辛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-zef7swv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-zef7swv","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《岭南采药录》：\"味苦辛，性温平，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-2cv8ate","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-2cv8ate","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-lcroacb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-lcroacb","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化痰，理气，健胃，消食。治胸中痰滞，咳嗽气喘，呕吐呃逆，饮食积滞。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-jsv9mlq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-jsv9mlq","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《纲目拾遗》：\"治痰症，消油腻、谷食积，醒酒，宽中，解蟹毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-k5wxk0g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-k5wxk0g","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，1～2钱；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-oqqf9np","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-oqqf9np","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】气虚及阴虚有燥痰者不宜服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-dswyytz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-dswyytz","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《*辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-nu8byas","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-nu8byas","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化橘红《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-et4smfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-et4smfy","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【出处】出自《识药辨微》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-0x6ca15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-0x6ca15","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【拼音名】HuàJúHónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-osfqxgr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-osfqxgr","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【英文名】PummeloPeel"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-92j6usw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-92j6usw","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【别名】化皮、化州橘红、柚皮橘红、柚类橘红、兴化红、毛柑、毛化红、赖橘红。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-hh6itmi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-hh6itmi","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【来源】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-bhi459c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-bhi459c","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药材基源：为芸香科植物化州柚或柚的未成熟或近成熟的外层果皮。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-mxbf1qp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-mxbf1qp","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：1.Citusgrandis（L.）Osbeckvar.tomentosaHort.2.Citrusgrandis（L.）Osbecd"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-kkeqlen","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-kkeqlen","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：10-11月果实未成熟时采收，置沸水中略烫后，将果皮割成5-7瓣，除去果瓤和部分中果皮，压制成形，晒干或阴干。化州柚的外果皮有毛，称毛橘红；柚的外果皮无毛，称光橘红。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-x4f20tz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-x4f20tz","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【原形态】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-362u7vs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-362u7vs","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.化州柚常绿乔木，高5-10m。小枝扁，幼枝及新叶被短柔毛，有刺或有时无刺。单身复叶，互生；叶柄有倒心形宽叶翼，长1-4cm，宽0.4-2cm；叶片长椭圆形或阔卵形，长6.5-16.5cm，宽4.5-8cm，先端钝圆或微凹，基部圆钝，边缘浅波状或有钝锯齿，叶背主脉有短柔毛，有半透明油腺点。花单生或为总状花序，腋生，白色；花萼杯状，4-5浅裂；花瓣4-5，长圆形，肥厚；雄蕊25-45，花丝下部连合成4-10组；雌蕊1，子房长圆形，柱头肩头状。柑果梨形、倒卵形或扁圆形，直径10-15cm，柠檬黄色。果枝、果柄及未成熟果实上被短柔毛。种子扁圆形或扁楔形，白色或带黄色。花期4-5月，果熟期10-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-pdosipb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-pdosipb","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.柚常绿乔木，高5-10m。小枝扁，幼枝及新叶被短柔毛，有刺或有时无刺。单身复叶，互生；叶柄有倒心形宽叶翼，长l-4cm，宽0.4-2cm；叶片长椭圆形或阔卵形，长6.5-16.5cm，宽4.5-8cm，先端钝圆或微凹，基部圆钝，边缘浅波状或有钝锯齿，有疏柔毛或无毛，有半透明油腺点。花单生或为总状花序，腋生，白色；花萼杯状，4-5浅裂；花瓣4-5，长圆形，肥厚；雄蕊25-45，花丝下部连合成4-10组；雌蕊1，子房长圆形，柱头扁头状。柑果梨形、倒卵形或扁圆形，直径10-15cm，柠檬黄色。种子扁圆形或扁楔形，白色或带黄色。花期4-5月，果熟期9-11月。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ogeb2me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ogeb2me","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【生境分布】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-qpvve70","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-qpvve70","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生态环境：栽培于丘陵或低山地带。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-u04cm43","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-u04cm43","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：1.栽培于广东化州、廉江、遂溪、徐闻，广西南宁及博白等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-1qgnwt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-1qgnwt7","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.浙江、江西、福建、台湾、湖北、湖南、广东、广西、四川、贵州、云南等地均有栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-8qb1wvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-8qb1wvw","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【栽培】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ck91hwc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ck91hwc","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生物学特性喜温暖湿润气候，不耐干旱，年降雨量需900-1500mm。抗寒性差，年平均温度需在16℃以上，最低生长温度为11℃，生长最适温度为23-29℃，最低日平均气温需在5℃以上。比较喜阴，尤喜散射光，年日照时数1200-1500h。宜选土层深厚、富含腐殖质、疏松肥沃的中性或微酸性土壤栽培，冲积土壤或红壤、黄壤、紫色土壤均可。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-uvnqqgc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-uvnqqgc","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培技术用种子、压条、嫁接繁殖，以嫁接繁殖为主。种子繁殖：培育实生苗供作砧木用，品种可选枳、红橘、酸橘、香橙。甜橙等，采集成熟果实，剥皮，取出种子洗净，置阴凉处，用湿砂贮藏备用。育苗：选饱满无病虫害的种子，播前用0.1％高锰酸钾浸10min，洗净，再拌以草木灰，于春季2-3月条播，覆土盖草保湿。约经半个月出苗，揭去盖草，施稀人粪尿，每隔20-30d施1次。压条繁殖：采用高空压条法，待生根后，秋季剪下假植。嫁接繁殖：用培育的苗作砧木，再从优良母株上选取接穗，春季切接或腹接，秋季以腹接为主；芽接6-9月；胚芽接亦可以。嫁接苗成活后，要加强管理，待亩高0.7-1m，根颈粗1-2cm时，即可出圃定植。选早春或秋季按行株距7m×5m或6m×5m，穴径1m，深1m开穴，穴底先放一层腐熟厩肥，再覆一展土，每穴栽1株，填土压实，浇水。注意栽种时要使根部舒展，与土壤密接，覆土与地面平。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-akhi8e0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-akhi8e0","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"田间管理幼树要勤松土除草，追施氮肥，以粪肥为主。并可间作粮食、蔬菜、绿肥等。高温季节，可在植株附近盖草防止水分蒸发，保持土壤湿度。成年树每年要将果园耕翻1次，松土除草2-3次。发芽、稳果、壮果期施人畜粪肥，适当增施磷、钾肥。整形修剪：主干高50-70cm，保留3-4主枝，主枝间隔距离约3-6cm，主枝较长时要摘心短截。栽后l-2年要疏去全部花蕾，促梢生长，形成自然圆头形的树冠，轻剪，疏除密枝、细弱枝，长枝适当短截。成年树冠内部两年生的无叶较弱枝条、下垂枝要轻剪，疏除叉枝、重叠枝。对绿叶层剪去枯枝、病虫枝、衰老枝、徒长枝、细弱枝，疏剪顶端和外围的密集枝，短截生长旺盛的夏、秋梢，使树冠部通风透光，使较弱无叶枝开花结果。气温低于-10℃的地区，应注意防冻，可用石灰硫黄合剂和石灰液涂刷，并用稻草扎主干、主枝；并可在冻前灌水。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-zqxwb8k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-zqxwb8k","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病虫害防治病害有黄龙病，是一种病毒通过蚜虫传播，要消灭传染源，建立无病苗圃，发现病株，立即拔除。脚腐病，为害极颈部，可刮除病斑，涂1：1：10波尔多液。另有花叶病。虫害有柑橘红蜘蛛的成虫、若虫，为害叶片、嫩枝、幼果，可用天敌山黑瓢螂、六点蓟马防治。吹绵介壳虫的若虫、雌虫为害树干、枝叶等，可用天敌大红瓢虫及澳洲瓢虫防治或喷松脂合剂，或用50％马拉硫磷乳剂1000倍液防治。网纹绵介壳虫，可用天敌蜡纷跳小蜂防治或0.5波美石硫合剂防治。此外，还有褐天牛、星天牛、凤蝶潜叶蛾等为害。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-bkb061b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-bkb061b","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性状】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-a1t44kn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-a1t44kn","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状鉴别（1）毛橘红果皮呈对折的七角、六角或展平的五角星状，也有单片者呈柳叶形。完整者展平后直径15-28cm，厚0.2-0.5cm。外表面黄绿色，密生茸毛，有皱纹及小油点。内表面黄白色或淡黄棕色，有脉络纹。质脆，易折断，断面不整齐，外缘有1列不平整的凹下油点，内侧稍柔而有弹性。气香，味苦、微辛。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-sh07xcn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-sh07xcn","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）光橘红外表面黄绿色至黄棕色，无毛。均以片薄均匀、气味浓者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-gpt602v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-gpt602v","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别果皮横切面：（l）化州柚（毛橘红）表皮细胞1列，外被冷质层，有时可见1-5细胞的非腺毛，长至110μm。中果皮细胞排列疏松，外侧有长圆形油室，径向长90-365μm，切向长490-980μm；薄壁细胞中含草酸钙方晶。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-2i7rx1w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-2i7rx1w","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）柚（光橘红）表皮无非腺毛；油室径向长380-1220μm，切向长285-810μm。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-0jz0uuq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-0jz0uuq","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末特征：暗绿色至棕色。①表皮细胞多角形或类方形，气孔类圆形或长圆形，直径18-31μm，副卫细胞5-7个，排成放射式。②中果皮的细胞壁不均匀增厚，厚6.5-22.μm（不加热测量）。③草酸钙方晶易见，长9-18μm。④螺纹或网纹导管，直径6-17μm。⑤油室碎片中可见油滴，分泌细胞扁任形。偶见石细胞及纤维。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-xvzfpyz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-xvzfpyz","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【化学成份】柚的外果皮含挥发油，主成分为柠檬醛（citral），牻牛儿醇（geraniol），芳樟醇（linalool），邻氨基本甲酸甲酯（methylanthranilate）。另据报道，挥发油中主含柠檬烯（limonene），还含a-蒎烯（a-pinene）等。又谓挥发油中尚含丁香烯氧化物（caryophylleneoxide），芳樟醇单氧化物（linaloolmonoxide），顺式-3-己烯醇（cos-3-hexenol），荜澄茄烯（cadnene），二戊烯（dipentene）等。又含黄酮类成分：柚皮甙（naringin），新橙皮甙（neohesperidin），枳属甙（poncirin），福橘素（tan-geretin），川陈皮素（nobiletin），5，7，4’-三甲氧基黄酮（5，7，4＇-trimethoxyflavone），5，6，7，3＇，4＇-五甲氧基黄酮（5，6，7，3’，4＇-pentamethoxyflavone），5，7，8，3，4’-五甲氧基黄酮（5，7，8，3＇，4＇-pentamethoxyflavone），5，7，8，4＇-四甲氧基黄酮（5，7，8，4＇－te-tramethoxyflavone）等。还含水苏碱（stachydrine），伞形花内酯（umbelliferone），橙皮油内酯（aruapten），腐胺（prtrescine），焦性地茶酚（pyrocatechol），番茄烃（lycopene），甘氨酸（glycine），β谷甾醇葡萄糖甙（β-sitosterol-β-D-glucoside），二十九烷（nona-cosane）等。又含蛋白质，脂肪，糖类，胡萝卜素，维生素B1，B2，C，烟酸，钙，磷。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ud9eh72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ud9eh72","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【药理作用】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-tdi9k9f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-tdi9k9f","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.抗炎作用：柚皮甙给小鼠腹腔注射l00mg/kg，可降低甲醛性足踝浮肿，但对5-羟色胺引起的炎症无效；柚皮甙静脉注射50-250mg/kg，可抑制大鼠因静脉注射微血管增渗素（Kallidine）引起的毛细血管通透性增强。所含柚皮甙有消炎镇痛作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-9g0obyy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-9g0obyy","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.其它作用：柚皮甙（2g/kg饮食）与致栓塞（Thrombogenic）饲料喂养大鼠，可延长动物的存活时间，并具有降低血小板聚集，增快血流等作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-88beb5l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-88beb5l","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【毒性】柚皮甙毒性很小，以1%含量的柚皮甙食物喂饲大鼠200日，未见毒性反应。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-61d4x1n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-61d4x1n","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【鉴别】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-dxo5ccm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-dxo5ccm","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"理化鉴别（1）取本品粉末1g，加甲醇10ml，加热回流20min，放冷，滤过。取滤液1ml，加四氢硼钾约5mg，摇匀，加盐酸数滴，即显樱红色或紫红色。（检查二氢黄酮类成分）（2）薄层色谱取（1）项下滤液作供试液；另取抽皮甙加甲醇制成每1ml含0.4mg的溶液，作对照品溶液。吸取上述两种溶液各10μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以醋酸乙酯-甲酸-水（1O：2：3）的上层溶液展开，取出，晾干，喷以三氯化铝试液，置紫外光灯下检视。供试品色谱在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的荧光斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-f8wtxdp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-f8wtxdp","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标准《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定：本品以干燥品计算，含柚皮甙（C22。H32。O14·2H2O）不得于少1。5％。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-xcmvxal","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-xcmvxal","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-alwfetg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-alwfetg","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.拣去杂质，刷净，用时擘碎。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-unrokoj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-unrokoj","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.蜜制：取蜂蜜文火炼老，加水适量，再将橘红碎块倒入，拌包，炒至微黄色时，出锅，摊开晾凉，每100kg橘红，蜂蜜18.75kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-1yq9kt7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-1yq9kt7","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味】苦；辛；温"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-3flzmsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-3flzmsk","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【归经】脾；肺经"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-vr6wdxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-vr6wdxq","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功能主治】燥湿化痰；理气；消食。主风寒咳喘痰多；呕吐呃逆；食积不化；脘腹胀痛"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-zby3fkm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-zby3fkm","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【用法用量】内服：煎汤，3-6g；或入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-e4tehtz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-e4tehtz","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【注意】气虚及阴虚有燥痰者不宜服。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-lq34xse","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-lq34xse","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【附方】1.二陈汤(《太平惠民和剂局方》)，燥湿化痰，理气和中，治湿痰咳嗽。2.导痰汤(《妇人良方》)，燥湿祛痰，行气开郁，主治痰涎壅盛，胸膈痞塞，或咳嗽恶心，饮食少思，以及肝风挟痰，呕不能食，头痛头晕，甚或痰厥者。3.贝母瓜蒌散(《医学心悟》)，润肺清热，理气化痰，治肺燥有痰。4.涤痰汤(《济生方》)，涤痰开窍，治中风痰迷心窍，舌强不能言。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-ff57u6j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-ff57u6j","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【各家论述】"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-b46gt6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-b46gt6w","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《纲目拾遗》：治痰症，消油腻、谷食积，醒酒，宽中，解蟹毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-nwbgtca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-nwbgtca","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草从新》：化州陈皮，消痰至灵，然消伐太峻，不宜轻用。"}]},{"ID":"20240902084520-5i5bj8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084520-5i5bj8s","updated":"20240902084527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【摘录】《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240902084521-wpyoblu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240902084521-wpyoblu","updated":"20240902084527"}},{"ID":"20240902084522-elofwki","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240902084522-elofwki","updated":"20240902084527"}}]}